# Prune request — read by .github/workflows/prune-agent-branches.yml.
#
# Committing this file to concept2cure-v2 asks the prune workflow to delete
# every branch under the agent prefixes (claude/ codex/ copilot/ openai/
# cursor/ agent/ ai/ bot/), which CLAUDE.md Rule 0 says must not exist. The
# number below is the count the requester saw as eligible; if the live count
# differs when the job runs — because another agent session pushed a branch in
# between — the job FAILS CLOSED rather than deleting a set nobody reviewed.
#
# The workflow deletes this file after a successful prune, so the request is
# spent once and a later push cannot silently re-fire it. Remove the DELETE
# line (or the file) to cancel; a push with no readable DELETE line is a dry
# run.
#
# Eligible at the time of writing: 551 agent branches, 15 kept
# (concept2cure-v2, 14 dependabot/*, deps/brace-expansion).

DELETE 551
